# Optional. If unset, the app derives the backend's address from whatever
# host was used to load THIS page, assuming the backend is on port 8000 of
# that same host — correct for local dev and docker-compose.
#
# Once the frontend and backend are deployed to different hosts/domains
# (e.g. two separate Render services), set this to the backend's real URL,
# e.g. https://transitsync-backend.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
